@startuml
title Rios Vivos — what happens after upload and chat questions
autonumber

actor User
participant "Existing upload page\n/dashboard/management/rag" as Upload
participant "Existing chat page\n/dashboard/rag" as Chat
participant "system-api" as API
queue "Task queue" as Queue
participant "AI computer" as AI
database "Saved task status" as Status

== Upload or replace a document ==
User -> Upload : choose file
Upload -> API : upload file
API -> Status : save Waiting
API -> Queue : add file task
API --> Upload : show Waiting
Queue -> AI : read and prepare file for search
AI -> Status : Ready or Failed
API --> Upload : show live status\n(or page asks for saved status)

== Ask in chat ==
User -> Chat : send question
Chat -> API : ask question
API -> Status : save Preparing answer
API -> Queue : add question task
API --> Chat : show Preparing answer
Queue -> AI : find allowed text\nand write answer
AI -> Status : save answer and sources
API --> Chat : show answer\nwith document links and quotes

note over Upload,Chat
The page never waits for the AI computer.
It shows progress while the task runs in the background.
end note
@enduml
